    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Number of trained people and trainings/workshops related to PRELT
- Number of trained people and trainings/workshops related to peacekeeping
- Number of workshop/trainings organized on topics related to conflict prevention, resolution and peacebuilding</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2021">
