     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Strengthening knowledge on topics related to PRELT (Preventing Radicalization and Extremism leading to Terrorism)
- Contribute to knowledge building on topics related to conflict prevention, resolution peacebuilding, and peacekeeping</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- 5 trainings for a total of 207 participants in issues related to PRELT and DDR
- 11 trainings for 1243 participants in peacekeeping
- 7 trainings under this output for 319 participants in peacemaking and peacebuilding</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
