- Contribute to knowledge building on topics related to conflict prevention, resolution peacebuilding, and peacekeeping</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Enhanced African and Arab communities&#x2019; resilience to Radicalization and Extremism Leading to Terrorism (PRELT) and Disarmament, Demobilization and Reintegration (DDR) through 2 trainings for 30 participants where knowledge gained by participants was at 70%
-Enhanced African and Arab capacities in peacekeeping through 11 trainings and workshops for 2,274 participants where their knowledge gained was at 70%
- Enhanced African and Arab knowledge on Conflict Prevention and Resolution through 3 trainings for 992 participants where their knowledge increased by 70% 
- Enhanced African &amp; Arab capacities in combating human trafficking and smuggling of migrants through 3 trainings for 23 participants, knowledge level scored 70%</narrative>
      </comment>
